{
  "_comment": [
    "Shipped catalog of provider Plans. A Plan is a provider offer, independent of",
    "our Subscription that held it. Each Plan has dated versions; a version may carry",
    "price, qualitative limits, sources, and a curated default_reference.",
    "",
    "provider_groups[].aliases is the only adapter-to-rate-card bridge: OpenAI <-",
    "codex | openai. Stored account and rate-card IDs are not migrated.",
    "",
    "usd_per_month: null means unverified, never free. default_reference is published",
    "only by editing this repository file; ordinary local API writes cannot change it.",
    "A missing token vector stays absent with a reason - never inferred from another",
    "Plan, version, or provider-wide mix. Multiplier/qualitative limits stay in",
    "`limits`, not as a fabricated token vector.",
    "",
    "Prices, dates and sources: TALK-002 catalog-seed.json / catalog-research.md.",
    "Scalar/multiplier capacity claims from that seed are kept as limits or as an",
    "explicit absent reference. No token values were invented."
  ],
